Ever wondered exactly how hard that sword hit?
[B]DamageIndicator[/B] shows the damage floating above the mob, with the health it has left.[/CENTER]

[SIZE=5][B]✨ Features[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Damage[/B] above the mob's head, like [FONT=Courier New]-5❤ [15❤][/FONT]
[*][B]Healing[/B] in another colour, like [FONT=Courier New]+4❤ [19❤][/FONT]
[*][B]Your own text[/B] with colours, gradients and formatting ([URL='https://docs.papermc.io/adventure/minimessage/format/']MiniMessage[/URL]), and the placeholders [FONT=Courier New]{damage}[/FONT], [FONT=Courier New]{heal}[/FONT], [FONT=Courier New]{current}[/FONT], [FONT=Courier New]{max}[/FONT]
[*][B]Adjustable:[/B] how long the text stays, its size, where it appears, whole numbers or decimals
[*][B]Blacklist[/B] for mobs that shouldn't show numbers (players by default)
[*][B]Respects protection:[/B] no numbers when WorldGuard or another plugin cancels the damage
[*][B]Spigot, Paper, Purpur and Folia[/B], Minecraft [B]1.19.4 – 26.3[/B], one jar for all of them
[*][B]Lightweight:[/B] one short-lived text entity per hit, never saved with the world
[/LIST]

